  "body": "# MCOM submission 260914-LiuVincent\r\n\r\nFrozen reproduction delivery for the exact manuscript submitted on 14 September 2026. This is not journal acceptance or completed external reproduction.\r\n\r\nFull Git commit: b6cd2183c1e79c6c27a34267812a7b2d73ed1b59\r\n\r\nTag: v1.0-mcom-submission\r\n\r\nDownload w200-frozen-artifact.zip for the complete292-file original mathematical package. The small automatic Source code archive is not the complete numerical package. w201-reviewer-materials.zip contains the exact tagged64-file reviewer wrapper plus full commit/tag identity. SHA256SUMS binds the original ZIP, reviewer wrapper and original24-page manuscript PDF.\r\n\r\nOriginal ZIP SHA-256: 7f8e47d265326cbfa4da95197c98bc226fe6cbfd8a22e6896955c18d8cdb376d\r\n\r\nOriginal PDF SHA-256: 91126eee6ceb5315a4a40a4d4b2f34d058a71432ae18a8aaf47146f71abf418e\r\n\r\nMCOM_SUBMISSION = COMPLETED\r\nEXTERNAL_REPRODUCTION = NOT_YET_COMPLETED\r\nREPRODUCTION_HANDOFF = READY\r\n\r\nSee REPRODUCIBILITY.md for Theorem B clean reconstruction and the separate Theorem A retained-proposal route. The frozen files and historical records are unchanged. No RH proof or disproof is claimed, and no new blanket license is granted. A Zenodo DOI has not yet been obtained.\r\n"
